      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i started taking quetiapine for my anxiety a couple weeks ago and im having a really hard time falling asleep at night bc my mind just wont shut off. is it okay if i take some of my old zolpidem (ambien) with it just to make sure i actually get some sleep? i dont wanna be awake all night again",
